    "detailed_description": "Mikey and Grover's Unexpected Adventure is a point and click adventure, featuring retro hand drawn pixel art and animations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/d8bdcdc65d81824be7e8616f7c3c4f87.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/d8bdcdc65d81824be7e8616f7c3c4f87.apng?t=1742757575\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Mikey is an ordinary kid who enjoys a good snack and really hates spiders. But above all else, he loves guitars!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/9842b07b683dbb0a3561efe473404ee1.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/9842b07b683dbb0a3561efe473404ee1.webm?t=1742757575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>On his 12th birthday Mikey wished for his dream guitar, the Bender SG200.<br>But alas, Mikey\u2019s wish did not come to pass.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/a68dbb78e09886e1bb8d9a20760724f3.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/a68dbb78e09886e1bb8d9a20760724f3.webm?t=1742757575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>So, when Mikey learns from his uncle Chuck about the tales of hidden treasures in the lighthouse, he makes the responsible decision and drags his best bud Grover on a hunt for that long lost treasure.<br><br>Mikey will hear many different stories about the lighthouse, some of them are absolutely bananas. Or, are they?<br><br>The boys don\u2019t really know what they\u2019ll find over there, anything is possible, but they are ready and they are brave... No. That\u2019s a very strong word... They are fearless... Wait, no, that\u2019s not it either... They\u2019ll somehow, with a little bit of luck, make it through a bunch of unexpected adventures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/e08854146e41b893600e8f892913e76e.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/e08854146e41b893600e8f892913e76e.apng?t=1742757575\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Talk to town's peoples and learn all about the tales of the lighthouse. Gather items, solve puzzles and make your way to that treasure!<br><br>The full story will be set in 6 parts. The demo features part 1.<br><br>The game is suitable for all ages and contains no foul language or violence.",
    "about_the_game": "Mikey and Grover's Unexpected Adventure is a point and click adventure, featuring retro hand drawn pixel art and animations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/d8bdcdc65d81824be7e8616f7c3c4f87.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/d8bdcdc65d81824be7e8616f7c3c4f87.apng?t=1742757575\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Mikey is an ordinary kid who enjoys a good snack and really hates spiders. But above all else, he loves guitars!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/9842b07b683dbb0a3561efe473404ee1.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/9842b07b683dbb0a3561efe473404ee1.webm?t=1742757575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>On his 12th birthday Mikey wished for his dream guitar, the Bender SG200.<br>But alas, Mikey\u2019s wish did not come to pass.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/a68dbb78e09886e1bb8d9a20760724f3.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/a68dbb78e09886e1bb8d9a20760724f3.webm?t=1742757575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>So, when Mikey learns from his uncle Chuck about the tales of hidden treasures in the lighthouse, he makes the responsible decision and drags his best bud Grover on a hunt for that long lost treasure.<br><br>Mikey will hear many different stories about the lighthouse, some of them are absolutely bananas. Or, are they?<br><br>The boys don\u2019t really know what they\u2019ll find over there, anything is possible, but they are ready and they are brave... No. That\u2019s a very strong word... They are fearless... Wait, no, that\u2019s not it either... They\u2019ll somehow, with a little bit of luck, make it through a bunch of unexpected adventures.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/e08854146e41b893600e8f892913e76e.poster.avif?t=1742757575\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2151850/extras/e08854146e41b893600e8f892913e76e.apng?t=1742757575\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Talk to town's peoples and learn all about the tales of the lighthouse. Gather items, solve puzzles and make your way to that treasure!<br><br>The full story will be set in 6 parts. The demo features part 1.<br><br>The game is suitable for all ages and contains no foul language or violence.",
    "short_description": "Mikey and Grover go on a treasure hunt in a mysterious ancient lighthouse. It seems that everyone in town has a different theory about what is hidden in the lighthouse. The boys don't know what they'll find there, anything is possible. Join them as they embark on a bunch of unexpected adventures!",
